1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,780
Every day, your bank sends you messages about your money.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,263
A payment here. A bill there. Your salary. Before long, you lose track.

3
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:09,938
Meet Kharcha.

4
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:15,411
It reads the payment messages from your bank, and sorts every rupee for you, on its own.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,355
See what you earned, spent, and saved this month, at a glance.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,296
Find out where your money really goes, month after month.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,961
Every UPI, card, and cash payment, in one simple list.

8
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:30,944
And never miss a credit card bill again.

9
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:37,665
Best of all, it's private by design. No sign-up. No server. Your data never leaves your phone.

10
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:42,571
Kharcha. Know where your money goes. Coming soon on Google Play.
